WEBVTT

00:00.660 --> 00:04.580
Tuchukulie nina

00:04.580 --> 00:06.640
watu wawili hapa

00:06.640 --> 00:13.090
Kisha nitaongeza wengine 3.

00:13.090 --> 00:15.130
Nawaongeza wengine 3

00:15.130 --> 00:16.990
Hii ni picha halisi,

00:16.990 --> 00:20.160
lakini nina watu wangapi hapa?

00:20.160 --> 00:22.940
Vizuri, watu 2, kwa hali ya kawaida tunaweza kuandika

00:22.940 --> 00:26.610
mtu jumlisha mtu

00:26.610 --> 00:28.280
ngoja niandike

00:28.280 --> 00:31.600
mtu jumlisha mtu mwingine, watu 2.

00:31.600 --> 00:33.610
Tunaweza kuzidisha 2 mara mtu mmoja,

00:33.610 --> 00:35.770
na hii ni njia nyingine ya kuandika.

00:35.770 --> 00:40.900
Kwa hiyo watu 3-- unaweza kuchukua mtu

00:40.900 --> 00:45.290
jumlisha mtu jumlisha mtu.

00:45.290 --> 00:47.300
Kisha tutakuwa na jumla ya--

00:47.300 --> 00:50.000
na hii inaweza kuwa rahisi kwako.

00:50.000 --> 00:52.660
Utakuwa na jumla ya watu 1, 2, 3, 4,

00:52.660 --> 00:54.450
5.

00:54.450 --> 01:00.582
Hivyo hii ni sawa na watu 5.

01:00.582 --> 01:02.540
Hebu tufanye mifano mingine ya kufikirika

01:02.540 --> 01:05.209
kwa sababu picha ni rahisi kutambua.

01:05.209 --> 01:07.330
hebu sasa tufanye

01:07.330 --> 01:09.380
kwa kutumia aljebra.

01:09.380 --> 01:13.720
Kama nina 2x na kumbuka, unaweza

01:13.720 --> 01:16.260
kuandika kama 2x au 2 mara x.

01:19.370 --> 01:23.220
Kisha nitaongeza 3x. Je nina x ngapi?

01:23.220 --> 01:25.450
vizuri, kwa mara nyingine, 2x, ni 2 mara x.

01:25.450 --> 01:27.410
unaweza kufanya hivyo kwa kuchukua x jumlisha x.

01:27.410 --> 01:29.270
Hatujui thamani ya x ni ngapi?

01:29.270 --> 01:32.460
Lakini thamani yoyote ya hiyo namba tutakayoipata tutaijumlisha yenyewe.

01:32.460 --> 01:34.780
Na 3x zitakuwa ndiyo hiyo thamani.

01:34.780 --> 01:37.590
Ngoja nitumie rangi hii hii ya kijani.

01:37.590 --> 01:41.640
3x zitakuwa hiyo thamani jumlisha hiyo thamani jumlisha

01:41.640 --> 01:43.460
thamani yoyote itakayokuwa.

01:43.460 --> 01:46.300
Kwa hiyo nina x ngapi hapa?

01:46.300 --> 01:50.810
Vizuri, nina 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 x

01:50.810 --> 01:57.119
hivyo, 2x jumlisha 3x ni sawa na 5x.

01:57.119 --> 01:59.660
kama ulifuatilia kwa makini, tulichokifanya

01:59.660 --> 02:01.160
utakuwa umeshakielewa--tumejumlisha

02:01.160 --> 02:03.950
hizo namba 2ambazo zilizidishwa kwa x.

02:03.950 --> 02:07.350
Na hizi namba, yaani 2 au 3, zinaitwa kizidishi

02:07.350 --> 02:09.860
Neno linalovutia, lakini ni namba ile ile,

02:09.860 --> 02:12.980
ya kawaida ambayo imezidishwa kwa namba

02:12.980 --> 02:16.814
umeongeza 2 na 3

02:16.814 --> 02:18.730
Hebu tufanye tena mfano mwingine

02:18.730 --> 02:21.400
Hebu turudi kwenye mlinganyo wa mwanzo, watu 2

02:21.400 --> 02:23.400
Watu jumlisha 3.

02:23.400 --> 02:27.380
Tufanye tulitakiwa kuongeza

02:27.380 --> 02:31.680
matunda damu 7

02:31.680 --> 02:34.050
kwa hiyo huu ni mchoro wa tunda damu.

02:34.050 --> 02:38.410
Kwa hiyo tuna matunda damu 7 jumlisha watu 2 jumlisha watu 3

02:38.410 --> 02:41.040
kisha nikaongeza matunda damu 2 mengine.

02:41.040 --> 02:42.950
Naongeza matunda damu 2 hapa.

02:42.950 --> 02:44.990
Je jumla itakuwa ngapi?

02:44.990 --> 02:48.170
Nitaongeza 7 kwenye 2 kwenye 3 jumlisha 2.

02:48.170 --> 02:49.750
Tunaongeza vitu tofauti hapa.

02:49.750 --> 02:51.950
Una watu 2 na wengine 3,

02:51.950 --> 02:54.895
Tutarahisisha watu 5

02:54.895 --> 02:57.020
Kisha tutakokotoa tofauti haya matunda damu.

02:57.020 --> 02:59.700
Tuna matunda damu 7, kisha tunaongeza matunda damu 2.

02:59.700 --> 03:01.820
Tutakuwa na matunda damu 9.

03:01.820 --> 03:06.920
ni sawa na matunda damu 5 na watu 9

03:06.920 --> 03:07.810
matunda damu 9.

03:07.810 --> 03:12.360
halikadhalika, hapa, badala ya 2x jumlisha 3x,

03:12.360 --> 03:21.970
Kama nilikuwa na 7y jumlisha 2x jumlisha 3x jumlisha 2y, je jibu lake ni nini?

03:21.970 --> 03:24.050
siwezi kuzijumlisha x na y.

03:24.050 --> 03:26.420
Zinaweza kuwakilisha namba tofauti.

03:26.420 --> 03:28.590
Ninachoweza kufanya ni kuongeza x

03:28.590 --> 03:30.022
kisha na kupata 5x.

03:30.022 --> 03:31.480
pia ningeweza kujumlisha y tofauti

03:31.480 --> 03:35.800
Kama nina 7y kisha nikaongeza 2y, nitapata 9y.

03:35.800 --> 03:38.170
Kama nikiwa na 7 nikajumlisha

03:38.170 --> 03:40.440
Ninapata 9

03:40.440 --> 03:42.710
Kwa hiyo nitapata 9y

03:42.710 --> 03:44.235
kwa hiyo jumlisha.

03:44.235 --> 03:45.740
Tumia rangi tofauti.

03:45.740 --> 03:48.700
Umejumlisha hii na hii.

03:48.700 --> 03:50.140
ukapata.

03:50.140 --> 03:54.070
Umejumlisha x

03:54.070 --> 03:56.064
Ukapata hii

03:56.064 --> 03:57.730
Kwa hiyo inaleta maana.

03:57.730 --> 03:59.313
nitatumia njia nyingine

03:59.313 --> 04:04.530
Kama hii, nini kitatokea kama ningechukua 2x jumlisha 1

04:04.530 --> 04:08.407
jumlisha 7x jumlisha 5?

04:08.407 --> 04:09.990
Unaweza pia

04:09.990 --> 04:11.350
kuchukua 2 jumlisha 1,

04:11.350 --> 04:12.220
lakini tunajumlisha vitu tofauti.

04:12.220 --> 04:12.970
hizi ni 2x

04:12.970 --> 04:14.910
Hii ni namba 1.

04:14.910 --> 04:17.490
Kwa hiyo unatakiwa ujumlishe x pamoja

04:17.490 --> 04:19.430
kwa hiyo utasema nilipata 2x

04:19.430 --> 04:21.550
kisha nitaongeza 7x

04:21.550 --> 04:23.507
ina maana nimepata 9x

04:23.507 --> 04:25.090
kisha unaweza kusema

04:25.090 --> 04:27.130
nimeweka namba ya kubuni 1.

04:27.130 --> 04:28.460
kisha nina nyingine 5.

04:28.460 --> 04:32.280
1 jumlisha 5 itakuwa 6.
